    <title class="- topic/title " xtrc="title:1;4:12" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/ktcri/OneDrive/Desktop/Harness/Introduction.dita">Introduction</title>
    <shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc " xtrc="shortdesc:1;5:16" xtrf="file:/C:/Users/ktcri/OneDrive/Desktop/Harness/Introduction.dita">Harness.io manages the full lifecycle of the CI/CD (Continuous Integration/Continuous
        Deployment) process. You can define and automate your build, test, and deployment pipelines
        using easy-toc-configure YAML files, and the pipelines can also be version-controlled,
        making updates and changes simpler. Harness supports parallel execution of jobs, allowing
        you to run builds, tests, and deployments simultaneously.</shortdesc>
